<title>NORWAY: Norway Seafoods to get Oslo listing on Friday.</title>
<headline>Norway Seafoods to get Oslo listing on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway Seafoods, the world's largest catcher and processor of white fish, will be listed on the Oslo bourse from Friday, a statement from the bourse said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Norway Seafoods is around 67 percent owned by Norwegian industrial holding company Aker RGI ASA.</p>
<p>The stock has a nominal value of five crowns per share.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
